flowchart TD
  START([You or a daily schedule<br/>run the digest]) --> PAUSED{Paused after<br/>a YouTube block?}
  PAUSED -->|yes| STOP([Stop until<br/>the pause date])
  PAUSED -->|no| FEEDS[Read new videos<br/>from channel feeds]
  FEEDS --> FILTER[Skip shorts, livestreams<br/>and old videos]
  FILTER --> JUDGE{LLM: on topic<br/>and not sponsored?}
  JUDGE -->|no| SKIP([Skipped])
  JUDGE -->|yes| TR[Download transcript]
  TR --> SHORT[LLM writes a short note]
  SHORT --> DIGEST[Digest note lists<br/>the day's videos]
  DIGEST --> READ([You read the notes<br/>in Obsidian])
  READ -->|tick deep_dive| DEEP[Next run: LLM writes<br/>a deep dive]
  classDef you fill:#a5d8ff,stroke:#1971c2
  classDef code fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#f08c00
  classDef ai fill:#d0bfff,stroke:#6741d9
  classDef out fill:#b2f2bb,stroke:#2f9e44
  classDef stop fill:#ffc9c9,stroke:#e03131
  class START,READ you
  class FEEDS,FILTER,TR code
  class JUDGE,SHORT,DEEP ai
  class DIGEST out
  class STOP,SKIP stop
